 "key_big": "Complete o 10 primeiro.",
 "key_sub": "Se 7 + 5 = 12, então 12 − 5 = 7.",
 "body_html": "<h2>Como pensar</h2><p>Os <b>fatos básicos</b> são as contas com números de 0 a 10, como 7 + 5 e 12 − 5. Saber de cor ajuda em todas as outras contas.</p><p>Para passar do 10, complete o 10 primeiro: 8 + 5 = 8 + 2 + 3 = 13.</p><p>Use os <b>dobros</b>: 6 + 6 = 12, então 6 + 7 = 13.</p><p>A subtração desfaz a adição: se 7 + 5 = 12, então 12 − 5 = 7 e 12 − 7 = 5.</p><div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 428 88' width='428' height='88' role='img' aria-label='8 maçãs mais 5 maçãs'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><circle cx='26.0' cy='28.0' r='11.0' fill='#e05a4f' stroke='#9b2d24' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='26.0' y1='18.0' x2='27.5' y2='13.0' stroke='#6b4423' stroke-width='2.4' stroke-linecap='round'/><ellipse cx='32.0' cy='15.0' rx='5.0' ry='2.6' fill='#006633' transform='rotate(-30 32.0 15.0)'/><circle cx='62.0' cy='28.0' r='11.0' fill='#e05a4f' stroke='#9b2d24' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='62.0' y1='18.0' x2='63.5' y2='13.0' stroke='#6b4423' stroke-width='2.4' stroke-linecap='round'/><ellipse cx='68.0' cy='15.0' rx='5.0' ry='2.6' fill='#006633' transform='rotate(-30 68.0 15.0)'/><circle cx='98.0' cy='28.0' r='11.0' fill='#e05a4f' stroke='#9b2d24' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='98.0' y1='18.0' x2='99.5' y2='13.0' stroke='#6b4423' stroke-width='2.4' stroke-linecap='round'/><ellipse cx='104.0' cy='15.0' rx='5.0' ry='2.6' fill='#006633' transform='rotate(-30 104.0 15.0)'/><circle cx='134.0' cy='28.0' r='11.0' fill='#e05a4f' stroke='#9b2d24' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='134.0' y1='18.0' x2='135.5' y2='13.0' stroke='#6b4423' stroke-width='2.4' stroke-linecap='round'/><ellipse cx='140.0' cy='15.0' rx='5.0' ry='2.6' fill='#006633' transform='rotate(-30 140.0 15.0)'/><circle cx='170.0' cy='28.0' r='11.0' fill='#e05a4f' stroke='#9b2d24' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='170.0' y1='18.0' x2='171.5' y2='13.0' stroke='#6b4423' stroke-width='2.4' stroke-linecap='round'/><ellipse cx='176.0' cy='15.0' rx='5.0' ry='2.6' fill